SUMMARY:Living Collections Members Night
DESCRIPTION:We invite Members to enjoy special after-hours access to our Living Collections Team. Meet remarkable animals up close\, hear from expert staff\, and discover behind-the-scenes stories you won’t experience during regular hours. This exclusive evening is our way of saying thank you for supporting the Museum—bringing you closer to the living world you help protect. \n\nPreview the Living Conservatory before it opens for the season.\nStop by the Acro Café for dinner or snacks.\nEnjoy animal presentations in Windows on the World\, presentations at 6:30pm\, 7pm\, & 7:30pm.\nStop by our tank-side Keeper Talks on the 3rd floor.\n\nDoors open at 6pm\, last entry 7:45pm. \nCurrent membership and pre-registration required. Recommended for all ages. Not a member yet? Join today! \nRegister Now!
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/living-collections-members-night/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,All Ages,Children,Member Exclusive,Teens
ORGANIZER;CN="Katie%20Cupp":MAILTO:Katie.Cupp@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
