SUMMARY:Virtual Naturalist: Sea Turtles
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever been lucky enough to see a sea turtle in the wild? These beautiful reptiles have some amazing adaptations that allow them to live in salt water.  Join us for a virtual program perfect for ages 8+ to learn about how they survive in the ocean\, and what you can do to help protect them. \n\n\n\n\nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/virtual-naturalist-sea-turtles/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Citizen Science,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="Jennifer%20Tredway":MAILTO:jennifer.tredway@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
