SUMMARY:Return of the Wild: Lewis & Clark Resurvey Livestream (Whiteville)
DESCRIPTION:Starting May 1\, Museum mammalogist Dr. Roland Kays and colleagues will retrace the historic route of Lewis and Clark\, comparing historic wildlife observations to what camera traps find today. Along the way\, Kays and company will meet local experts to learn how animal populations have changed over the 250 years of our country’s history. Follow along on the Return of the Wild site and YouTube channel . \nJoin the expedition at our Whiteville location or watch the livestream on YouTube to receive the latest updates on the trek.\n\n1:00pm on Sunday May 3\n1:00pm on Sunday May 9\n1:00pm on Saturday May 16\n11:00am on Thursday May 28\n11:00am on Thursday June 4
